Description:The opponent controls Leyline of the Void and Glorious Anthem. You have Allay and Snapcaster Mage in hand and W W W W U U floating. End the turn with both enchantments in the opponent's graveyard.
Rule:rulesguru-5ffe544be39b6e05 | Putting the spell into its owner's graveyard is the last step of resolution (CR 608.2n), after Leyline of the Void is destroyed, so Allay aimed at the Leyline goes to the graveyard; Snapcaster Mage then gives it flashback for the Anthem
